This is a list of the 64 [[Hexagram (I Ching)|hexagrams]] of the ''[[I Ching]]'', or ''Book of Changes'', and their [[Template:Unicode chart Yijing Hexagram Symbols|Unicode character codes]].

The list is in [[King Wen sequence|King Wen order]]. (Cf. [[King Wen sequence#Other hexagram sequences|other hexagram sequences]].)

